  <id>2115883</id>
  <releasedate>2025-04-25</releasedate>
  <summary>&lt;p>This is a simplified fork of Kickoff which is KDE Plasma 6 Desktop's default Application launcher. The design is minimalized without compromising on power and important features.&lt;br />&lt;br />For Plasma 5 variant, &lt;a href="https://www.pling.com/p/1819888/">click here&lt;/a>&lt;br />&lt;br />Powerful Plasma Search&lt;br />The search bar uses Plasma Search, which is the same search provider used in the default Kickoff, Krunner and the Overview effect which supports powerful plugins.&lt;br />&lt;br />NOTE: This is based off from Kickoff which can be found in /usr/share/plasma/plasmoids/org.kde.plasma.kickoff/, on every Linux system that has KDE Plasma installed.&lt;/p></summary>
  <changelog></changelog>
  <preview>https://images.pling.com/cache/770x540-4/img/00/00/66/42/38/2115883/nordic-round-grid-1.png</preview>
  <previewBig>https://images.pling.com/cache/770x540-4/img/00/00/66/42/38/2115883/nordic-round-grid-1.png</previewBig>
