 <stuff category="706">
  <name>Toggle Overview Widget for Plasma 6</name>
  <providerid>api.kde-look.org</providerid>
  <author>himdek</author>
  <homepage>https://store.kde.org/p/2132554</homepage>
  <licence></licence>
  <version>1.5</version>
  <rating>68</rating>
  <downloads>57682</downloads>
  <installedfile>/home/mellow/.local/share/plasma/plasmoids/com.himdek.kde.plasma.overview/</installedfile>
  <id>2132554</id>
  <releasedate>2025-04-25</releasedate>
  <summary>&lt;p>Just a simple widget that opens the Overview on click. You can now put a button to open the Overview in panels and desktop. This can easily replace any Application Launcher as it has a powerful Krunner search box.&lt;br />&lt;br />&lt;a href="https://store.kde.org/p/2008499/">Click here&lt;/a> to get it for Plasma 5&lt;br />&lt;br />Overview effect in present in Plasma 5.24 and later and needs to be enabled in System Settings &amp;gt; Workspace &amp;gt; Desktop Behaviour &amp;gt; Desktop Effects &amp;gt; Overview&lt;br />&lt;br />It shows a virtual desktop switcher with previews and previews of every window open in the current desktop. It also has a Krunner search box.&lt;/p></summary>
  <changelog></changelog>
  <preview>https://images.pling.com/cache/770x540-4/img/00/00/66/42/38/2132554/screenshot-20230326-174011.png</preview>
